case ptab-robust-institution
uses ptab-patent-trial-appeal-board ^0.1.0
as_of 2026-08-26
summary "A petitioner's IPR under the FY2024 PTAB calibration, solved robustly over the 90% credible range of the probabilities."
notes "Ported from examples/ptab-robust-institution.json. A petitioner weighing an IPR from patent grant, with the PTAB FY2024 institution and outcome rates applied (calibration/ptab-fy2024.json); nothing has happened yet, so the matter sits at the package start. The rate is illustrative."
perspective petitioner

parties {
  petitioner: applicant Corporation
}

analysis {
  params: { rate: 750.usd / 1.hours }
  calibration: ["ptab-fy2024"]
  objective: { type: "robust", credibility: 0.9 }
}
